      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">The Soccer100 Experience</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        <strong>Soccer100</strong> is made for fans who love football. Our goal is to give you an easy way to watch live matches for free. We keep the high standards of <strong>totalsportek</strong> for all our <strong>soccer streams</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="mb-4">We cover all the major competitions:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-8">
        <li>Champions League & Europa League</li>
        <li>English Premier League</li>
        <li>Spanish La Liga</li>
        <li>Italian Serie A</li>
        <li>International Games</li>
        <li>And many more!</li>
      </ul>

